#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-install-upgrade.rst:63
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-install-upgrade.rst:66
msgid "Permissions and limitations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-install-upgrade.rst:68
msgid ""
"If you're using a package manager, such as Gitlab Omnibus, to manage your"
" Mattermost installation, the Mattermost system user won't have "
"sufficient permissions to perform the upgrade. If this is the case, "
"you'll need to change the file permissions manually."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-install-upgrade.rst:70
msgid ""
"Changing the permissions in this way doesn't affect your Mattermost "
"deployment or impact any data. The permission change is done solely for "
"the upgrade."
msgstr ""

