msgid ""
"To change the permissions using the command line on the Mattermost "
"server, you need access to the command line tool as *mattermost* user:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-install-upgrade.rst:74
msgid ""
"Open the command line tool on the Mattermost server and ``cd`` to the "
"Mattermost installation directory."
